{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_3000_situation", "source_sha256": "690bd51df2083b6681dbecdfed4c91987d863eef6fba5ece23d1c1e24229ad4e", "ja": "ラジオの公開録音　直前", "zh": "广播的公开录音　开始前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_3000_place", "source_sha256": "2eac3a40fc07710d441025c7f019e77f8c451a36bc6677b154f3b53ed164681e", "ja": "イベント会場", "zh": "活动会场", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_3001_p", "source_sha256": "bb40c70f7ec3269a05bed97271241eee2c9ccba109eef737a2036b49836b9b85", "ja": "（今日は、朋花のラジオ公録日だけど……早くも\n朋花ファンの子豚ちゃん達が集まってきているな）", "zh": "（今天朋花要举办广播节目的公开录音……\n这么早就有支持朋花的小猪们到场了呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_3002_031tom", "source_sha256": "6e875b0b61075ad68a138fb23a0f0b82502073a8c890754c4e01aeec3aae57f3", "ja": "今日は、いつもメールでしかやり取りできない\n子豚ちゃん達と直に会えて、うれしいですね～♪", "zh": "平常都只能跟小猪们透过信件往来，\n今天能直接见到小猪们，我真开心呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_3003_p", "source_sha256": "e1d3f437ead265e7f99ca6dcc684756efdf996a3c0997078a020be99b84389eb", "ja": "あっ、朋花。本番はもう少し先だから、\nまだ出てこなくてもいいぞ？", "zh": "啊，朋花，离开始还有一段时间，\n你不用那么早出去喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_3004_031tom", "source_sha256": "c69fdd4febc1f533db7dcf6e3689d092987ee1be4a40061001ce0943595181b2", "ja": "あら、{$P$}さん～？　聖母として、\n子豚ちゃんの声に応えるのは、当然の責務ですよ～？", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}先生～身为圣母，\n回应小猪的声音可是理所当然的义务喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_3005_031tom", "source_sha256": "aee893bb82326130240478659230ddaa6d8de9f5b3337689a552a1fc4e31f5e3", "ja": "それより、どうしたら子豚ちゃん達を喜ばせられるか、\n意見を聞かせてもらえませんか～？", "zh": "更重要的是，该如何让小猪们开心，\n能听听你的意见吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_3006_p", "source_sha256": "717997f00c9fc5dcd30254802dcaed9b9512eb4823c70a107bd729f66c7f2a05", "ja": "うーん、そうだな……。", "zh": "唔～这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_3007", "source_sha256": "f9c7f4281eb27526d2bbe34e94a76159330d11e302b5510497ff8ee881909bc4", "ja": "マイクなしで生声披露", "zh": "不用麦克风，展现原音", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_3008", "source_sha256": "ccfade13006496a3fd47d4c10f7cc837bd8ffe388501660cf41d423e29000e95", "ja": "朋花の生お仕置き", "zh": "朋花的现场惩罚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_3200_p", "source_sha256": "9e075986bd537731664263290365313ff8f41a18440a6e7c134669521f5c7616", "ja": "朋花の生の声を、\nマイクなしで披露してみるのはどうだ？", "zh": "不要使用麦克风，\n展现朋花原本的声音怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_3201_031tom", "source_sha256": "b025ba6dbbc4ce0c0d33deff9461bd0fe81bd6d479e5003762564bfaf087ac87", "ja": "なるほど、いつもは電波越しですからね～。\n{$P$}さん、考えましたね～♪", "zh": "有道理，平常都是透过电波传送呢～\n{$P$}先生，你的想法很好呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_3202_031tom", "source_sha256": "2f1c868ace8afec05cbb02a14fee897f388db7960b5cef5f7d18093460d6fcf9", "ja": "その意見、採用しましょう～。\n私の声を、子豚ちゃん達に聞かせてきますね～。", "zh": "就采用这项意见吧～\n我会让小猪们听听我的声音的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_3300_p", "source_sha256": "9e075986bd537731664263290365313ff8f41a18440a6e7c134669521f5c7616", "ja": "朋花の生の声を、\nマイクなしで披露してみるのはどうだ？", "zh": "不要使用麦克风，\n展现朋花原本的声音怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_3301_031tom", "source_sha256": "da94c1684d7a1d08cd212c4133e1cc7c33986831a6ee615f8d8e64426974b6d0", "ja": "悪くないですね～。会場の後ろの子豚ちゃんにも\n平等に聞こえるよう、配慮をお願いしますね～。", "zh": "还不错呢～那就麻烦你好好安排，\n让会场后方的小猪也能公平听见啰～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_3500_p", "source_sha256": "df319631c22c6f3aef007bef37affb6f861b10814fcf29ca0358eadbae9a5a79", "ja": "朋花の生お仕置き……とか？", "zh": "朋花的现场惩罚……之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_3501_031tom", "source_sha256": "1ca46583894ed6be9d84fec747ee386fc28b3a09b7cd4acc137b8f6f0a86040e", "ja": "{$P$}さん～？\n私は、真面目に聞いているんですよ～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生～？\n我是认真地在问你喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_3502_031tom", "source_sha256": "fbd595b1d753fdc4493c6cdf1ea373d89e458bc284e4886a666704d22aa91c6a", "ja": "ですが、お仕置きをねだる子豚ちゃんも多いですし……\n喜んで帰ってもらえるように、頑張りましょう～♪", "zh": "不过确实也有很多小猪央求着惩罚……\n那我就努力一下，让他们能开开心心地回家吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_3600_p", "source_sha256": "df319631c22c6f3aef007bef37affb6f861b10814fcf29ca0358eadbae9a5a79", "ja": "朋花の生お仕置き……とか？", "zh": "朋花的现场惩罚……之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_3601_031tom", "source_sha256": "14f42f80382dbcfc4a57ef503da3aa270f952e6875e347078f495d30e7e692eb", "ja": "{$P$}さん～？\nいくらなんでも、調子に乗りすぎではありませんか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生～？\n再怎么说，你这样是不是太得意忘形了～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_3602_031tom", "source_sha256": "b5668a904e792d41bf7dde92e1f960f19cb7f9657dda7da09779bcb237ee01d0", "ja": "日頃の態度に免じて、お仕置きは許してあげますが……\nもう少し、真面目に考えてくださいね～？", "zh": "看在平常的态度上，这次就不惩罚你了……\n请再正经一点思考喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
